    "summary": "An enemy unit that ends a Charge, Fall Back, Advance or **Normal move** within range of any objective marker you control takes a D6 roll: on a 2+, it suffers D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n\nEach **ANHRATHE** unit of yours has **Void Thieves**: as each phase ends, each objective marker under your control that this unit is in range of becomes [secured](vsdata:core-rule/secured-objectives).",
